      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef rto_check(size_gb, speed, setup, rto):\n    hours = setup + size_gb / speed\n    return [round(hours, 1), hours <= rto]\n\nprint(rto_check(900, 150, 1.5, 6))\nprint(rto_check(400, 200, 0.5, 4))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef rto_check(size_gb, speed, setup, rto):\n    hours = setup + size_gb / speed\n    return [round(hours, 1), hours <= rto]\n\nprint(rto_check(900, 150, 1.5, 6))\nprint(rto_check(400, 200, 0.5, 4))\n```"
    }
  ],
